      "content": "a small change or a tiny act of release... i dont know if that's even possible. it feels like everything about me is part of this cage. like even if i changed my routine, i'd still be the same person stuck in the same silence. it just feels like the walls are permanent. like there's no version of this where i actually feel free again.",
